  "description": "Send a little Christmas peace with an angel or dove tucked into your festive wrapping. These round sticker printables bring the Heavenly Christmas artwork to envelopes, gift bags and seasonal paper projects. Soft blue, warm ivory and antique gold connect a collection of angels, lambs, doves, bells, candles, a chapel and the Star of Bethlehem. Lace and torn paper details give the circles a nostalgic look that pairs beautifully with simple cream stationery. Use them to seal Christmas mail, decorate small presents or add a gentle religious accent to a journal page. Extra harp angel, bells and chapel stickers fill the sheet with more of those coordinating designs.\n✦ 12 round 2-inch circles\n✦ 1 two-page US Letter PDF and\n✦ 1 two-page A4 PDF. 1 printing guide PDF.\n✦ PDF sheets preserve the intended artwork size.\n✦ No cutting-machine paths or registration marks.\nPLEASE NOTE:\n✦ This product is a digital download only, no physical items will be sent to you.\n✦ Colors may slightly vary due to your monitor’s settings.\n✦ You may NOT redistribute, resell, copy or share the digital file in any way",
